## 🚀 Exploitation / Solution Path
Detail your step-by-step breakdown to get the flag:
1. Download the `message.txt` from challenge usng "wget".
2. Open the file with `cat` and observe the text.
3. There is a cipher text at start of the message and flag with cipher encoded at last.
4. Use `cyberchef(substitution)` for decoding paste cipher text in above field and normal text like `A-Z` alphabets in cipher text area and `ignore case (checkbox) as ticked` and paste `cipher encoded flag at top-right side` and clcik enter.
5. Another method is using from terminal using `echo and tr `commands.
6. The flag will appear.

